<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Sin, you helpless little fellow,</l><l>Lost your pow’r on Calvary.</l><l>I have made exchange of masters,</l><l>Now it’s Christ who rules in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>World, with all your little trappings,</l><l>You oppress with doubts and cares.</l><l>I have found a new provider,</l><l>My anxiety He bears.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Self, you cruel manipulator,</l><l>You are wholly crucified,</l><l>I have no more need to struggle,</l><l>In Christ’s vict’ry I abide!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Lord, when You return in glory,</l><l>When You then the kingdom bring;</l><l>By Your life my Lord then make me</l><l>Manifested as a king.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
